5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify if the staffing model is actually viable before we commit.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to see where the actual time is lost in the journey.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Let's look at the financial commitments that are hidden in the details.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,I will check the historical records to see what failed before.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I need to understand the approval bottlenecks and ground conditions.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, are you focusing on the immediate costs or the long-term liabilities?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, do you think the old pilots are still relevant to today's network?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, I am looking at the ledger to see what we are truly paying.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, history often repeats itself, so yes, the pilots are very relevant.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is important, but I am worried about the delays.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the roster books to see the actual capacity.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will look at the timed runs to verify the crowd complaints.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will examine the ticketing fees and the paving rates.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
