35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The late-turn pool is critically thin. Overtime is covering everything.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The mid-city runs are slower, but the platforms clear at the old rate.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The ticketing fees are eating into the paving budget. It is unsustainable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The accessibility programme had mixed results. Some lifts worked, lanes didn't.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ferry and rail back offices never agreed on data terms. That is a blocker.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if the fees are that high, how do we fund the new system?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, so the lane priority failed? That worries me for the bus corridor.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, the capital ledger has a ring-fenced balance, but it is for construction.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, yes, the lanes were returned to mixed traffic. It was a mistake.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, that ring-fenced money might not be available for operations.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The maintenance contract has spare capacity, but the crews are understaffed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"The journey audits show waiting for connections is the real problem, not paying.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The paving rates have climbed again. We need to be careful with roadworks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,The late-evening pilot met its cost-recovery target. That is a good sign.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The pre-war shells have heavy contingency pricing. We will hit voids and stop.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
