60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Given the roster issues, I am hesitant about extending night service.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"The bus corridor might work, but the lane priority history is concerning.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,The fare platform seems financially risky given the contractor fees.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Servas,,The station access upgrades have a track record of success in some areas.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,The data agreement issue makes the fare platform very difficult to implement.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, which specific parts of the accessibility programme succeeded?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, if the data terms aren't agreed, can we even start the fare system?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, the night service might be too expensive with the current staffing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, the lift and entrance rebuilds finished on time. The lanes did not.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, no, without the data agreement, the fare platform is stalled.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I think the station access upgrades are the most viable option.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I agree. The bus corridor has too many unknowns with the lanes.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I am leaning towards the station access upgrades as well.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Servas,,I support the station access upgrades. The history is on our side.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I also prefer the station access upgrades. The other options have too many blockers.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
